title: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › Finished, paused or left
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 4 of 5, after the run)
intro: What the person can do when the ten agents are done, when the run stops, when they go Back, and when they reopen a draft that already ran. Changing the details or the documents after the agents ran starts the run over: a toast says so and a banner on this step says it again. An agent that cannot finish waits for Retry or Skip, and an agent paused in Settings holds the run.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Scrubber finishes\nThe last of ten agents"
start s2 "Click 'Back' on step 5\n'Review & submit'"
toast t1 "Banner: 'All ten agents are done' (one message at a time: a question, a pause or changed records come first)\n'The draft and the four checks are ready. Nothing has been sent to the payer.'"
process p1 "Hint: 'Read the draft and sign it on the next step.'\n'Review & submit' switches on\n'Pause all agents' and 'Skip ahead' switch off"
process pStop "The run stops for a question, an agent that could not finish, a pause in Settings, or when the page is closed"
goto gFail "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › An agent could not finish"
goto gPause "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › Paused in Settings"
decision dWhat "What does the person do?"

click cTick "Tick or untick a 'To raise it further' box"
process pTick "Chance moves; the summary is rebuilt on the next step"
click cReview "Click 'Review & submit'"
goto gReview "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Review & submit › The draft and the summary"
click cBack "Click 'Back'"
click cStep "Click 'Intake', 'Eligibility & Benefits' or 'Clinical documentation' in the stepper"
process pLock "The stepper opens 'Review & submit' at any time\nBefore the agents finish it says 'The packet is built when the agents finish' and offers 'Go to Authorization preparation'"
screen sRec "The step that was clicked\nEverything is as it was left"
decision dEdit "Does the person change the records?"
process pSame "Nothing changed\nThe agents' work is kept"
click cCont "Click 'Continue'"
process pDirect "Straight back to step 4 'Authorization preparation'\nNo 'Start the agents?' question"
store stStale "A change to the patient, payer, member ID, level of care, request type, dates, diagnoses, reason, proposed change or retro reason\nOr a document added, removed or replaced"
process pReset "The run starts over: all ten agents back to 'Waiting'\nAnswers, ticked boxes, summary edits and a send-back note are cleared"
toast tToast "Toast on the step: 'Records changed after the agents ran'\n'Their work was cleared. The agents check again when you continue.'"
toast tBanner "On step 4 once the agents start again: 'Records changed after the last run. The agents re-checked.'\nIt goes away when all ten are done"
click cCont2 "Click 'Continue'"
overlay oConf "Start the agents?"
goto gStart "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › Start the run and watch it"
goto gQ "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › An agent asks a question"
end eBack "Step 4 shows the run as it was\nFinished agents stay finished"

group gResume "Opening a draft that already ran"
  start s3 "Click 'Continue', 'Watch', 'Answer' or 'Review and sign'\non a case in Case Manager › Being prepared\nOr 'Open in review and sign' / 'Send to payer' on a case page"
  process pOpen "The page opens that draft from its address\nIt is not reset\nA draft made from a request opens on Review & submit when it is ready, else on Authorization preparation"
  decision dFar "How far did the agents get?"
  process rNone "None yet\nOpens on the step it was left on: Intake, Eligibility & Benefits or Clinical documentation"
  process rMid "Some of the ten\nOpens step 4; the run carries on with the next agent"
  process rAsk "Waiting on a question\nOpens step 4 and the question pop-up shows at once"
  process rAll "All ten\nOpens step 5 'Review & submit'"
endgroup

s1 --> t1 --> p1 --> pStop --> dWhat
s2 --> p1
pStop -.-> gFail
pStop -.-> gPause
dWhat --> cTick --> pTick
dWhat --> cReview --> gReview
dWhat --> cBack --> sRec
dWhat --> cStep --> sRec
cStep -.-> pLock
sRec --> dEdit
dEdit -->|No| pSame --> cCont --> pDirect --> eBack
dEdit -->|Yes| stStale --> pReset --> tToast --> cCont2 --> oConf --> gStart
oConf --> tBanner

s3 --> pOpen --> dFar
dFar -->|0 of 10| rNone
dFar -->|1 to 9, no question| rMid
dFar -->|1 to 9, question open| rAsk
dFar -->|10 of 10| rAll
rMid --> gStart
rAsk --> gQ
rAll --> gReview
